{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Step into the shoes of a rookie trader dealing in reclaimed goods!</strong><br>Get a first taste of the world of salvaged container auctions in this free single-player demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you\u2019ll experience a vertical slice of the gameplay loop, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 auction zone</strong> \u2013 test your skills in the first location and take part in a container auction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 container to bid on</strong> \u2013 search its contents and try to score the best possible loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Basic cleaning and item restoration</strong> \u2013 bring salvaged goods back to life and increase their value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ability to sell items in your shop</strong> \u2013 set prices, make money, and explore the selling system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Access to the item appraisal area</strong> \u2013 find out the value of your items before putting them up for sale</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core gameplay loop</strong> \u2013 learn the basics of trading, bidding, and restoring items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do you have an eye for hidden gems?</strong><br>Try the demo of <i>Salvage Shop Simulator</i> and find out if you can turn trash into treasure!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Auction won","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3856510/cf07cde4900ce24fcfc318fbadfb604829873de6.jpg"},{"name":"The first day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3856510/c6f92b9618767a7ab38cbf6aa6fe9bb9a6730831.jpg"},{"name":"Starting the business","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3856510/9d6fe353d749c65bed497e9c03629f6f4088f453.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://s